1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mahidevran_Sultan '''Wikipedia'''], [https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mahidevran_Sultan Tr]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Mahidevran Sultan''' (Ottoman Turkish: ماه دوران سلطان, c. 1500[1] – 3 February 1580, birth name Malhurub Baharay or Rosne Pravane, other names Gülbahar, Gülbehar, Gülfrem, Gülden) was a wife of Suleiman the Magnificent[2][3] a
2 CONC nd the mother of Şehzade Mustafa, Şehzade Ahmed and Raziye Sultan.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Note''': Year of her birth as c. 1500 means circa what was not correct data, she was born in 1598 based on Turkish source. She was concubine of [https://www.geni.com/people/Suleiman-the-Magnificent/6000000007976831309 Suleiman 
2 CONC the Magnificent], before she became his 2nd wife as partner, some source said that they were never married, but based on turkish source she was married at date 5 Jan 1512. Mahidevran never had the title of Sultana in the hierarchy
2 CONC  of the harem and she was called simply "Mahidevran Hatun", although as the mother of the eldest son she still had the rank of [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kad%C4%B1n_(title)_ Baş Kadın]. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mahidevra
2 CONC n#cite_note-9 9] '''Nonetheless, in historical fiction she is often mistakenly given the title Sultan.''' [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mahidevran#cite_note-:2-10 10] [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mahidevran#cite_note-:3-11 11] 
2 CONC [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mahidevran#cite_note-:4-12 12] Her origin is not clear: Circassian, Albanian or Montenegrin origin. She was a daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/%D0%98%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%80-%D0%BC%D1%83%D1%80%D0%B
2 CONC 7%D0%B0/6000000028522887926 Prince Mirza Haydar Termuk "Abdullah"] and his wife [https://www.geni.com/people/Nazan-Begum-of-Giray/6000000091023534921 Princess Nazan], and descendant and member from noble Ottoman House and Dynasty 
2 CONC Termuk. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Cro: "Njeno etničko porijeklo nije potpuno poznato. Smatra se da je porijeklom s Kavkaza ili s područja današnje Albanije. Bila je kći kabardejskog princa Mirze termuka i njegove žene Nazan. Rođena je 1498. ili 1500. Prije nego št
2 CONC o je ušla u Prinčev harem zvala se Malhub Baharaj. ..." [https://hr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sultanija_Mahidevran see]
2 CONT
2 CONT En: "Her ethnic origin is not completely known. It is considered to be of origin from the Caucasus or from the area of today's Albania. She was the daughter of Kabardian prince Mirza Termuk and his wife Nazan. She was born in 1498
2 CONC  or 1500. Before she entered the Prince's harem, her name was Malhub Baharaj. ... [https://hr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sultanija_Mahidevran see]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mahidevran#Issue Issue]===
2 CONT
2 CONT With [https://www.geni.com/people/Suleiman-the-Magnificent/6000000007976831309 Suleiman], Mahidevran had one son:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/people/%C5%9Eehzade-Mustafa/385234156770011959 Şehzade Mustafa] (Manisa, 1516/1517 - Konya, 6 October 1553). Executed by his father.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was not daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Kanoko-of-Cherkessia/6000000186291406871 and https://www.geni.com/people/%D0%9D%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B6%D0%B0%D0%BD-%D0%93%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B9/6000000186291406906. Which exact sour
2 CONC ce mentioned that she was their daughter ?
2 CONT ------
2 CONT
2 CONT =Contents=
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1 Etymology
2 CONT * 2 Origins and early life
2 CONT * 3 Life with Suleiman
2 CONT * 4 Mustafa's provincial posts
2 CONT * 5 Later years and death
2 CONT * 6 Depictions in literature and popular culture
