2 CONT
2 CONT Ayşe Sultan (Ottoman Turkish: عائشه سلطان, "The Living One" or "womanly", c. 1465 - c. 1515) was an Ottoman princess, the daughter of Sultan Bayezid II and one of his concubine, Nigar Hatun. 
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ay%C5%9Fe_Sultan_(daughter_of_Bayezid_II)_ En], [https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ay%C5%9Fe_Sultan_(II._Bayezid%27in_k%C4%B1z%C4%B1)_ Tr]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ay%C5%9Fe_Sultan_(daughter_of_Bayezid_II)#Marriage Marriage]===
2 CONT
2 CONT ===[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ay%C5%9Fe_Sultan_(daughter_of_Bayezid_II)#Issue Issue]===
2 CONT By her [https://www.geni.com/people/G%C3%BCveyi-Sinan-Pasha/6000000205086883882 husband], Ayşe Sultan had two sons and five daughters:
