2 CONC 339835 daughter] of [https://www.geni.com/people/Hasan-Pasha-governor-of-Rumelia/6000000205087487834 Hasan Pasha], governor of Rumelia.[7] He had a daughter, [https://www.geni.com/people/Gevherhan-Hanim/6000000205086993885 Gevherh
2 CONC an Hanim].[8]
