2 CONC hmed-Bey/6000000205087807821 Sultanzade Dukakinzade Mehmed Ahmed Bey] (son of [https://www.geni.com/people/Gevherm%C3%BCl%C3%BCk-Sultan/6000000029696787207 Gevhermuluk Sultan]), Sanjak Bey of Ankara.[9] She had a daughter, [https:
2 CONC //www.geni.com/people/Mihrimah-Hanim/6000000205087720834 Mihrimah Hanim].
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/people/Gevher%C5%9Fah-Han%C4%B1msultan/6000000205086825844 Gevherşah Hanımsultan]. She first married [https://www.geni.com/people/Dukaginzade-Ahmed-Pasha/6000000205076373823 Dukakinoğlu Ahmed Pasha], with w
2 CONC hom she had a son, [https://www.geni.com/people/Dukanginzade-Ibrahim-Pasha/6000000205087505857 Dukanginzade Ibrahim Pasha], (d. 1582, who married his cousin [https://www.geni.com/people/Nesli%C5%9Fah-Han%C4%B1msultan/6000000205089
2 CONC 183834 Neslişah Hanımsultan], daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Gevherm%C3%BCl%C3%BCk-Sultan/6000000029696787207 Gevhermülük Sultan]) and a daughter, [https://www.geni.com/people/Fatma-Han%C4%B1m/6000000205087861894 Fatma H
2 CONC anim] (who in 1518 married [https://www.geni.com/people/Iskender-Bey-governor-of-Antalya/6000000205095612840 Iskender Bey], governor of Antalya). In second marriage, she married [https://www.geni.com/people/Ibrahim-Bey-governor-of
2 CONC -Filorine/6000000205095509861 Ibrahim Bey] (son of [https://www.geni.com/people/%C3%96mer-Bey/6000000205095689859 Ömer Bey] and brother of her sister [https://www.geni.com/people/Mihrihan-Han%C4%B1msultan/6000000205095871821 Mihri
2 CONC han Hanımsultan's] [https://www.geni.com/people/Hasan-Bey/6000000205095889826 husband]). They had a son, [https://www.geni.com/people/Iskender-Bey/6000000205096165826 Iskender Bey], and a daughter, [https://www.geni.com/people/Hac
2 CONC %C4%B1-Rukiye-Han%C4%B1m/6000000205096056834 Hacı Rukiye Hanım]. She died in Aleppo on 4 April 1552.
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/people/Kamer%C5%9Fah-Han%C4%B1msultan/6000000205091244835 Kamerşah Hanımsultan],[10] married on 6 July 1506 to [https://www.geni.com/people/Ahmed-Bey/6000000205091244840 Ahmed Bey], son of [https://www.geni
