1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C5%9Eehzade_Mehmed '''Şehzade Mehmed'''] (Ottoman Turkish: شاهزاده محمد; 1521 – 7 November 1543) was an Ottoman prince, son of Sultan Suleiman the Magnificent and his wife Hürrem Sul
2 CONC tan.[1] He served as governor of Manisa. 
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C5%9Eehzade_Mehmed En], 
2 CONT
