2 CONT # Nicolae Jorga: Geschiste des Osmanichen vol I, (trans: Nilüfer Epçeli) Yeditepe Yayınları, 2009, ISBN 975-6480-18-1, p 235
2 CONT # Lord Kinross:The Ottoman Centuries, (Trans. by Nilifer Epçeli) Altın Kitaplar, İstanbul,2008, ISBN 978-975-21-0955-1 p.49
