2 CONC and died (1 Nov 1524)  in Istanbul, Turkey, he was born (1484) in Šibenik, and died when he was exectued 1 Nov 1524 in Belgrade (some source said that he was executed in Edirne, Turkey ?) by Sultan Suleiman II. 
