2 CONC serving in the Livonian War. Though Ivan considered her beautiful and sweet natured, he discovered her a few months after their marriage having an affair with a prince named Devletev. Ivan forced Vasilisa to watch her lover be imp
2 CONC aled, and as further punishment, buried her alive in a cloister.
