2 CONT a)         ANDREAS .  The Masarelli Vatican manuscript names Andreas and Eudokia as the children of Manuel & his wife[586].  Georgios Phrantzes records that Emperor Ioannes VIII installed "stratopedarcham…Cantacuzeni filium propte
2 CONC r affinitatem et patrem eius protostratorum"[587].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ---, daughter of --- Sincrula Palaiologos.  The Masarelli Vatican manuscript names her as the wife of Andreas[588].  Andreas Kantakouzenos & his wife had three children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT *i)          son (-died aged 15).  The Masarelli Vatican manuscript records that the two (unnamed) sons of Andreas & his wife died aged 15 and 13 respectively[589].  
2 CONT
2 CONT *ii)         son (-died aged 13).  The Masarelli Vatican manuscript records that the two (unnamed) sons of Andreas & his wife died aged 15 and 13 respectively[590]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT *iii)        daughter (-died aged 5).  The Masarelli Vatican manuscript records that the (unnamed) daughter of Andreas & his wife died aged 5[591]. 
