1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://sh.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lala_Mustafa-pa%C5%A1a Sh], [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lala_Mustafa_Pasha En], [https://bs.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lala_Kara_Mustafa-pa%C5%A1a Bs], [https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lala_
