2 CONT
2 CONT After the death of the grand vizier Sokollu Mehmed Pasha, the princess's first choice for a new husband, Ösdemiroğlu Osman Pasha was not interesting. Her next choice was Kalaylıkoz Ali Pasha, the governor of Buda, who agreed to th
2 CONC e marriage, but when the imperial order came demanding his divorce, his wife's sorrow and suffering were said to have caused the city to revolt. Her marriage to Ali Pasha took place in 1584. Ismihan sultan died on 7 August 1585, a
2 CONC nd was buried in Hagia Sophia Mosque.
