1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''La grande souveraine la plus brillante Maria Yurievna, grande-duchesse de Pskov et Novgorod''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT The 16th century Polish Nobility
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.almanachdegotha.org/id221.html 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://pl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maryna_Mniszch%C3%B3wna 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marina_Mniszech 
2 CONT
2 CONT Tsaritsa of All Russia; Tenure	1605–1606; Coronation	8 May 1606; Spouse	False Dmitri I; False Dmitri II; Ivan Zarutsky; Issue	Ivan Dmitriyevich; Full name	La grande souveraine la plus brillante Maria Yurievna, grande-duchesse de P
2 CONC skov et Novgorod;  House	Herb Mniszech.PNG Family of Mniszchowie; Impostor House of Rurik; Father	Jerzy Mniszech; Mother	Jadwiga Tarło-Mniszech; Born	1588; Laszki Murowane,[1] Polish–Lithuanian Commonwealth, now in Sambir Raion, U
2 CONC kraine; Died	December 24, 1614 (age 26); Kolomna Kremlin, Tsardom of Russia;
2 CONT
2 CONT Marina Mniszech (Polish: Maryna Mniszchówna or Maryna Mniszech; Russian: Марина Мнишек (Marina Mnishek); also known as "Marinka the witch" in Russian folklore;[3] c. 1588 – 24 December 1614), was a Polish noblewoman, a Russian Tsa
2 CONC rina and a prominent warlord during Russia's Time of Troubles.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mniszech was a daughter of Polish Voivode Jerzy Mniszech - one of the organizers of the Dimitriads, which were insigated by the appearance of a man who claimed to be Ivan the Terrible's son. Marina Mniszech's marriage to the impos
2 CONC tor False Dmitri I provided an opportunity for the Polish-Lithuanian magnates to control their protégé. Mniszech met False Dmitri I around 1604 or 1605, at the court of one of the Commonwealth magnates, and agreed to marry him. In
2 CONC  return for her hand Dmitri promised her Pskov and Novgorod, and her father Smolensk and Severia. After Dmitri captured Moscow in June 1605, in November he sent a diplomatic mission to Poland, asking for Marina's hand and proposin
2 CONC g a military alliance to defeat the Ottomans.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT https://pl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maryna_Mniszch%C3%B3wna
2 CONT --------------------
