1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Wikipedia''': [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ivan_III_of_Russia Einglish], [https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%98%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD_III_%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87 Русский]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Ivan III Vasilyevich''' (Russian: '''Иван III Васильевич'''), also known as Ivan the Great. Born 22 January 1440, Moscow, died 27 October 1505, Moscow.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ivan the Great, was a Grand Duke of Moscow and "Grand Prince of all Rus" (Великий князь всея Руси). Sometimes referred to as the "gatherer of the Russian lands", he tripled the territory of his state, ended the dominance of the Go
2 CONC lden Horde over the Rus, renovated the Moscow Kremlin, and laid the foundations of the Russian state. He was one of the longest-reigning Russian rulers in history.
