2 CONT * [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anatolian_Seljuks_family_tree '''Anatolian Seljuks family tree''']
2 CONT
2 CONT =Sources=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Claude Cahen, Pre-Ottoman Turkey: a general survey of the material and spiritual culture and history, trans. J. Jones-Williams, (New York: Taplinger, 1968) 271-279.
