2 CONC Krämer, Denis Matringe, John Nawas, Everett Rowson. Brill Online, 2012. Reference. Accessed 10 July 2012 <http://referenceworks.brillonline.com/entries/encyclopaedia-of-islam-3/ahmed-i-COM_22989> Börekçi, "Mustafa I," p.409. Börek
2 CONC çi, "Mustafa I," p.409. Boyar, Ebru and Kate Fleet. A Social History of Ottoman Istanbul. New York: Cambridge University Press, p.42 Boyar and Fleet. A Social History, p.42 Imber, Colin. The Ottoman Empire: The Structure of Power,
2 CONC  2nd ed. New York: Palgrave Macmillan, 2009, pp. 66-68, 97-98. ISBN 0-230-57451-3. Imber. The Ottoman Empire, pp. 98-99. Imber. The Ottoman Empire, p. 99. Boyar and Fleet. A Social History, p.42 Börekçi, "Mustafa I," p.409. Kramer
