2 CONT .... Stolink of Peter the Great, governor of Belgorod, general-porutchik, senator, Prince.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Yuri Troubetzkoy
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Yuri Troubetzkoy (20 April 1668 – 8 September 1739) was stolnik (courtier) of Peter the Great in 1676 and 1682, stolnik in the Tsar's apartment in 1712, the governor of Belgorod since 1727, a general-poruchik, senator since 1730, 
2 CONC Prince.
2 CONT
2 CONT His mother was Irena Golicyn 1657 (after 1643–1679) and his father was Yuri Troubetzkoy.
2 CONT
