2 CONT
2 CONT ===Saint Ketevan===
2 CONT
2 CONT ქეთევან წამებული.png
2 CONT
2 CONT * Queen of Kakheti
2 CONT * Tenure	1601–1602
2 CONT * Spouse	David I
2 CONT * Issue
2 CONT
2 CONT * * Teimuraz I
