2 CONT Princess Shahzadeh ‘Alamiyan Zobeydeh Beygom (b. 4 December 1586-k. 20 February 1632). She had issue, three sons and one daughter, including: Jahan-Banoo Begum, married in 1623, Simon II of Kartli son of Bagrat VII of Kartli by hi
2 CONC s wife, Queen Anna, daughter of Alexander II of Kakheti. She had issue, a daughter: Princess ‘Izz-e-Sharif.
2 CONT
2 CONT Princess Shahzadeh ‘Alamiyan Khan Agha Beygom, married Mirza Abu Talib ‘Ala ud-din Muhammad al-Husaini al-Marashi, son of Mir Rafi ud-din Muhammad Khalifa Isfahani. She had issue, four sons and four daughters.
