2 CONT
2 CONT according to the book The Rise and Rule of Tamerlane
2 CONT  By Beatrice Forbes Manz Sevinsh Qutluq Agha married - not Bahram Bayazid but - Kaykhusrow after the death of her husband Emir Husayn
2 CONT --------------------
