2 CONT Mikołaj Radziwiłł, Lithuanian: Mykalojus Radvila also known as Mikołaj Radziwiłł The Seventh (1546–1589) was Reichsfürst of the Holy Roman Empire and a Polish-Lithuanian noble (szlachcic), Great Chamberlain of Lithuania in the Gra
2 CONC nd Duchy of Lithuania and later in Polish-Lithuanian Commonwealth. Voivode of Nowogródek Voivodeship, starost mozyryski and merecki. Member of the Radziwiłł family. He was a Calvinist.
