2 CONT
2 CONT **a)         BERNARDINO (-before 1630).  m ---.  The name of Bernardino's wife is not known.  Bernardino & his wife had one child:
2 CONT
2 CONT ***i)          BONIFAZIO ([1583/84]-2 Dec 1630).  m ---.  The name of Bonifazio's wife is not known.  Bonifazio & his wife had one child:
2 CONT
2 CONT ****(a)       BONIFAZIO .  1679.  He was court surgeon at Casale[384].  m ---, daughter of GIAMBATTISTA Bobina & his wife ---.  Bonifazio & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT *****(1)       GIAMBATTISTA Paleologo .  1687.  He was court surgeon at Casale[385].  Ancestor of SILVIO, who lived around 1900[386]. 
