1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Tsarevna Irina Mikhailovna (Russian: Ирина Михайловна) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: 22 April 1627  Died: 8 February 1679 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Tsar Michael I of Russia Mother: Eudoxia Streshnev Spouse: None Issue: None
2 CONT
2 CONT Irina Mikhailovna was the eldest daughter of Tsar Michael of Russia from his second marriage to Eudoxia Streshneva, a noblewoman from Mozhaysk. She was the elder sister of Alexis of Russia. She was baptized in the Chudov Monastery
2 CONC  by Patriarch Filaret. In 1643, Irina was to marry Prince Valdemar Christian of Denmark, but after arriving in Russia he refused to convert to the Orthodox faith and was imprisoned until 1645.
2 CONT
