2 CONC ad marched from Kabul in an effort to assist Husayn, arrived in Herat and stayed there for a while, but noted the weakness of the brothers and left without making battle with the Uzbeks. The next year, the Uzbeks captured Herat, b
2 CONC ringing an end to Timurid rule there, and the brothers fled. Muzaffar died shortly after. Badi' went to Kandahar to muster forces and marched against the Uzbeks, but was defeated.He then came to the court of Ismail I of Persia, wh
2 CONC ere he was given lands surrounding Tabriz and 3650 gold shorafins a year. 
2 CONT
