1 OCCU Bullrush Voivode; 1641 – 1661 in Tighina), son of Vasile Lupu, was Voivode (Prince) of Moldavia between 1659 and 1661, and again in 1661.
1 TITL duke
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Stefan Lupu, nicknamed Papura-Voda, son of Vasile Lupu, was Prince of Moldavia
2 CONT
2 CONT between 1569 and 1661, and again in 1661. Appointed by the Porte as a result of his father's efforts (during their in exile in Istanbul), Stefan took over the throne at the tender age of 16. His rule was twice overthrown by former
2 CONC  Wallachian Prince Constantin Serban, who occupied Yashi and took over as Voivode. These harassments, coupled with Ottoman demands and Tatar raids, caused a deep crisis in Moldavia, worsened by an epidemic of what was thought to b
2 CONC e the bubonic plague. The Prince ended his life due to an illness, while assisting Turks and Tatars in fortifying Budjak against Cossacks.
