2 CONC k Mamuka [Manuchar] I Dadiani, Duke of Dukes of Mingrelia. Installed by King Vakhtang V of Kartli, 1661. m. (first) at Tbilisi, Kartli, 1660 (div. 1663) and remarried 1678, H.M. The Most High Queen Thamar (m. second, 1663, as his 
2 CONC third wife, div. 1678, and remarried 1679, H.M. The Most High King Bagrat IV, King of Imereti; m. fifth, May 1683, H.M. The Most High King Giorgi III Gurieli, King of Imereti; and d. 1683), younger daughter of General His Splendou
2 CONC r The Pious Prince of High Rank Konstantini I, 7th  Prince of Mukhrani, by his wife, Her Splendour The Pious Princess of High Rank Darejan, daughter of Prince Ghuanna Abashidze. m. (third) 1663, Her Splendour The Pious Princess of
2 CONC  High Rank Tinatina, widow of The Noble Goshadze, and daughter of H.M. The Most High King Aleksandri III, King of Imereti, by his wife, H.M. The Most High Queen Nestan-Darejan, elder daughter of H.M. The Most High King Taimuraz I 
2 CONC [Taimurazi Khan], King of Kartli and Kakheti. He d. 1681, having had issue, one son and one daughter and a natural son
