2 CONT The Keraites (also Kerait, Kereit, Khereid ; Хэрэйд Mongolian  ;Karait كرايت (kārayit) or كريت (karayit) Perso-Arabic  were one of the five dominant Turco-Mongol tribal confederations (khanates) in the Altai-Sayan region during th
2 CONC e 12th century. They had converted to the Church of the East (Nestorianism) in the early 11th century and are one of the possible sources of the European Prester John legend. (ref:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Keraites)
2 CONT --------------------
