2 CONC of Venice 1389/90 for the islands of Sasene and Torre di Pirgo.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (1372) BALŠA Balšić, son of BALŠA Lord of Skadar & his wife --- (-killed in battle near Berat 18 Sep 1385).  He obtained Valona, Berat, Himara and Kanina as dowry on his marriage[472].  He succeeded as Lord of Zeta, in the
2 CONC  territories of his older brother Djuradj, on the latter's death in 1379.  He captured Durazzo from Karlo Thopia in 1385, calling himself Duke of Durazzo in Apr 1385[473].  He was killed fighting the Turks.  
