2 CONT '''Michael Angelović'''[a] (fl. 1451–73) (Serbian: Михаило Анђеловић) was a Serbian magnate, initially serving the Serbian Despotate with the titles of veliki čelnik and veliki vojvoda, and briefly part of the Serbian three-member
2 CONC  regency in 1458. He plotted with the Ottomans but was apprehended and after brief captivity joined his brother, Ottoman official [https://www.geni.com/people/Mahmud-Angelovi%C4%87-13th-Grand-Vizier/6000000205117325825 '''Mahmud P
2 CONC asha'''], as a Timariot. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ====[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Michael_Angelovi%C4%87#Origin Origin]====
2 CONT After the Ottoman conquest of Thessaly in 1394, the ruling [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angelos Angeloi] [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Philanthropenos Philanthropenoi] family took refuge in Serbia. Michael and his brother (the 
2 CONC later [https://www.geni.com/people/Mahmud-Angelovi%C4%87-13th-Grand-Vizier/6000000205117325825 '''Mahmud Pasha''']) were grandchildren of either [https://www.geni.com/people/Caesar-Alexios-Angelos-Philanthropenos/60000000085218827
2 CONC 97 '''Alexios'''] or [https://www.geni.com/people/Caesar-Manuel-Angelos-Philanthropenos/6000000008521782674 '''Manuel''']. He may have also been related to the noblemen [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alessio_Spani Alessio] and [ht
2 CONC tps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peter_Spani_(League_of_Lezh%C3%AB)_ Peter Spani] through [https://www.geni.com/people/Alexios-III-byzantine-emperor/6000000000515214098 '''Alexios III Angelos'''], who was possibly their ancestor.[1] Ac
2 CONC cording to [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laonikos_Chalkokondyles Laonikos Chalkokondyles], his brother was captured by the horsemen of Sultan Murad II, while traveling with his Serbian mother from Novo Brdo to Smederevo.[2] His b
2 CONC rother was abducted as part of the devşirme practice, and became Mahmud, later rising to the highest ranks of the Ottoman Empire, becoming beylerbey (governor-general) of Rumelia in 1451 and Grand Vizier in 1455. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ====[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Michael_Angelovi%C4%87#Career Career]====
2 CONT
2 CONT ====[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Michael_Angelovi%C4%87#Legacy Legacy]====
2 CONT
