2 CONT =Ferenc Thurzó=
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Baron Thurzó de Bethlenfalva'''
2 CONT (Ferenc Thurzó de Bethlenfalva) Died on 12 March 1576
2 CONT
2 CONT Thurzó Ferenc - többek között - a család megmentése érdekében hagyta ott az egyházi rendet, így ez a lépés a család magyarországi ágának kihalás előli megmentése szempontjából döntő.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Parents===
2 CONT
2 CONT * János Thurzó, Baron Thurzó de Bethlenfalva +1528/1534
2 CONT * Anna Abaffy
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriages and children
2 CONT
2 CONT Married in 1557 to Barbara Kostka, with
2 CONT # Ágnes Married on 21 June 1562 to Katalin, Comtesse Zrinyi 1548-1585, with
2 CONT # Anna
2 CONT # György V
2 CONT # Katalin
2 CONT ===Notes===
2 CONT Ferencz was the son of János Thurzó de Bethlenfalva and Anna Abáffy de Nagyabafálva. Raised as a Catholic, he chose a religious vocation and rose to become bishop of Nyitra. However, after changing religion to become a Protestant 
2 CONC he became count of Nyitra and grand treasurer of Hungary. On 21 June 1562 in Burg Monyorokerek, he married Katalin Zrinski, daughter of Nikola IV Zrinski, ban of Croatia, Slavonia and Dalmatia, and Katalin Frangepan de Veglia. The
2 CONC y had a son and two daughters who would have progeny. Still quite young, he died of snakebite on 12 March 1574. His widow Katalin married Baron Imre Forgách de Ghymes et Gács.
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p4121.htm#i123761
2 CONT
2 CONT =Ferencz Thurzó, Baron de Bethlenfalva, Bishop & Count of Nyitra, Grand Treasurer of Hungary=
2 CONT 1
2 CONT * M, b. circa 1543, d. 12 March 1574
2 CONT * Father János Thurzó, Lord of Bethlenfalva1 d. bt 1528 - 1534 
2 CONT * Mother Anna Abáffy de Nagy-Abafálva1 d. a 1534 
2 CONT * Ferencz Thurzó, Baron de Bethlenfalva, Bishop & Count of Nyitra, Grand Treasurer of Hungary was born circa 1543.1 He married Katalin Zrinski, daughter of Nikola IV Subic Zrinski, Ban of Croatia & Slavonia, Treasurer of Hungary a
2 CONC nd Katarina Frangepan, on 21 June 1562 at Burg Monyörokerek.1 Ferencz Thurzó, Baron de Bethlenfalva, Bishop & Count of Nyitra, Grand Treasurer of Hungary died on 12 March 1574; Died of a snakebite.1
2 CONT * Family Katalin Zrinski b. 30 Apr 1548, d. 26 Apr 1585  
2 CONT * Child 
2 CONT # ◦Anna Thurzó+1 b. 13 Oct 1565, d. 4 Jul 1599
2 CONT
