1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Catherine of Austria''' (1533-1572) was one of the fifteen children of Ferdinand I, Holy Roman Emperor and Anna of Bohemia and Hungary. In 1553, she married Polish King Sigismund II Augustus and became Queen con
2 CONC sort of Poland and Grand Duchess consort of Lithuania. Their marriage was not happy and they had no children together. After a likely miscarriage in 1554 and a bout of illness in 1558, Sigismund became increasingly distant. He tri
2 CONC ed but failed to obtain a divorce from the pope. In 1565, Catherine returned to Austria and lived in Linz until her death. Sigismund died just a few months after her bringing the Jagiellon dynasty to its end. [https://en.wikipedia
2 CONC .org/wiki/Catherine_of_Austria,_Queen_of_Poland Wikipedia EN]
