0 @N6000000002244402515@ NOTE He attempted to reconstruct the Hungarian state after decades of feudal
1 CONT anarchy, chiefly by means of financial, military, judiciary, and
1 CONT adminstrative reforms. Elected by a general Diet, this was the first time in
1 CONT the medieval Hungarian kingdom that a member of the nobility, without
1 CONT dynastic ancestry and relationship, mounted the royal throne, causing a long
1 CONT series of controversies in that part of Europe. Matthias always succeeded, by
1 CONT force or diplomacy, to calm social & political conditions of his sovereignty.
