0 @N6000000002322333000@ NOTE Cousin to Czar Theodore and father to Czar Michael, he was force by Czar
1 CONT Boris Godunov to take monastic vows under the name of Philaret c1601. He
1 CONT reformed church administration, established divinity colleges in each
1 CONT diocese, minimized Roman Catholic influence and sponsered legislation to
1 CONT reform the tax structure, and, he reorganized the army. He became co-ruler
1 CONT with Michael, his son, from 1619-1633. He was called Fyodor, before Boris
1 CONT ordered him to take Monastic vows under the name on Philaert in 1601.
